"""blink-8M in the standard library, checked against the reference tokenizer.

The token ids and vectors below were made once, on the build Mac, by the
model's own tokenizer library (HF tokenizers 0.23.3) and NumPy following the
model's encoder: drop [UNK], mean the rows, scale to unit length. They are
the reference this pure-Python copy must match.
"""

